    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "In the center of Inlet Beach, this lovely house provides a great place to relax during your upcoming trip. You'll be just a short walk away from the stunning Rosemary Beach, and a quick 4-minute drive to the picturesque Alys Beach and Carillon Beach. 10 Min to Pier Park and Panama City Beach!<br><br>As a traveler, you'll love the cozy cottage, where you can unwind after a day of exploring. Stay connected with the free WiFi, and enjoy the convenience of the in-unit washer and dryer. Curl up on the comfortable couch and watch your favorite shows on the smart TV.<br><br>The fully stocked kitchen is a chef's dream, with a stove, oven, refrigerator, microwave, and dishwasher, as well as a coffee maker and blender. Gather around the dining table and savor delicious meals together.<br><br>Refresh in the 2.5 bathrooms, stocked with towels and basic soaps, and get ready for the day with the hair dryer. An iron and board are available for your convenience.<br><br>If you prefer to explore, the popular areas of Rosemary and 30A are just a quick 5-minute bike ride away, offering a plethora of dining, shopping, and entertainment options. The underground pedestrian crossing is almost complete which will make accessing 30A a breeze.<br><br>Whether you're seeking a relaxing retreat or an adventure-filled getaway, this vacation home has everything you need for an unforgettable stay in Inlet Beach/ Rosemary beach.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
